{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dice roguelike where luck is built face by face. Design your own dice, combine special effects, and face enemy cards with unique abilities that challenge your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/2aa089ed93d32456458caf24a51ae228.poster.avif?t=1759245017\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/2aa089ed93d32456458caf24a51ae228.webm?t=1759245017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are not just obstacles: they are cards with personality that sabotage your plans. Some block your rolls, others twist your effects\u2026 and all of them force you to think before you throw the dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/beb271d82e4dbeebb9364b69e314f2e8.poster.avif?t=1759245017\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/beb271d82e4dbeebb9364b69e314f2e8.webm?t=1759245017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice:</strong> combine numbers and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic roguelike:</strong> each run offers new challenges and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy cards:</strong> disruptive abilities that change the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy + luck:</strong> fast, tense, and addictive runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless effects, enemies, and unique bosses</strong><br>Discover over <strong>XXX special effects</strong> that reshape your dice and multiply the strategic possibilities of every roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/f761f6e360471930e24d0406fee8d111.poster.avif?t=1759245017\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/f761f6e360471930e24d0406fee8d111.webm?t=1759245017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>XXX unique bosses</strong> with mechanics that twist your dice to their will, turning every battle into an unpredictable challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/140867bbb2aeb47c72b6fa200f50e795.poster.avif?t=1759245017\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/extras/140867bbb2aeb47c72b6fa200f50e795.webm?t=1759245017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Tactics, creativity, and a bit of luck will decide your fate.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034870?t=1759245017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034870?t=1759245017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034870/142ff36c05d91d5c02fdc86295fa68d704244c28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759245017","capsule_imagev5":"https://s